\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 \strokec2 2. Analytical Logic: Numerator vs. Denominator\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec2 To maintain institutional integrity and avoid sub-group bias, the project implements a "Full Population" denominator approach:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Weighted Numerator:
\f1\b0  The sum of weights for individuals in a specific segment who possess the chosen stability anchor (e.g., worked 50\'9652 weeks).\
\ls1\ilvl0
